        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kim Ki-duk, Song Kang-ho\n- Films: Rough Cut, A Taxi Driver\n- Awards: 90th Academy Awards, Best Foreign Language Film\n- Roles: director, assistant director\n\nFacts:\n- Kim Ki-duk won an Academy Award before the events described in this chunk.\n- The film A Taxi Driver debuted in 2017.\n- The director of A Taxi Driver had previously worked as an assistant director to Kim Ki-duk on Rough Cut.\n- Song Kang-ho starred in A Taxi Driver in the title role.\n- South Korea selected A Taxi Driver as its entry for the Best Foreign Language Film at the 90th Academy Awards.",
