        "original_id": "b741a834-b582-5861-9719-688032a79043",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jang Hoon, Kim Ki-duk, Song Kang-ho, Thomas Kretschmann, Juhn Jai-hong\n- Films: Rough Cut, Secret Reunion, The Front Line, A Taxi Driver, Beautiful, Poongsan\n- Roles: directors, assistant directors\n\nFacts:\n- In 2008, Jang Hoon directed the film \"Rough Cut.\"\n- Kim Ki-duk gave the script for \"Rough Cut\" to his former assistant director Jang Hoon.\n- In 2010, Jang Hoon directed the film \"Secret Reunion.\"\n- In 2011, Jang Hoon directed the film \"The Front Line.\"\n- Kim Ki-duk gave scripts to his former assistant director Juhn Jai-hong for the films \"Beautiful\" and \"Poongsan.\"\n- In 2017, Jang Hoon directed the South Korean historical action drama film \"A Taxi Driver.\"\n- \"A Taxi Driver\" stars Song Kang-ho in the title role alongside Thomas Kretschmann.",
